  "description": "Seo Hyo-Min, an actor with a handsome face and outstanding acting skills, but who has been in obscurity for a long time. One day, he receives a business card from someone who is interested in him. The owner of the business card is Kang Soo-Heon, a third-generation chaebol known as a sponsor for new male actors. Hyo-Min was worried that he might be the sponsor of a perverted old man, but Soo-Heon appeared in front of him, and he was handsome. When Hyo-Min confessed(?) that he was a virgin, Soo-Heon became interested...\n\n *\"Should I be affectionate at first or... should I be so affectionate that he loses his mind?\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
